  "ruleText": "Ph 102.01 Statutory Definitions Adopted. All terms used in these rules shall have the same meaning as in RSA 318:1, RSA 318-B:1 and RSA 541-A:1.\n\nSource. #1639, eff 11-1-80; amd by #1856, eff 11-9-81; ss by #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-A, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED: 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-A, eff 2-5-96",
